{"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SQ","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SH","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:13ShortestPaths19DijkstraSearchEventO","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearch.swift#L17","fileName":"DijkstraSearch.swift"},"symbolKind":"enum","roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol","title":"DijkstraSearchEvent","modules":[{"name":"ShortestPaths"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DijkstraSearchEvent"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DijkstraSearchEvent"}]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"What a Dijkstra search reports, in order, with the events of the Boost Graph Library’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Dijkstra visitor.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DijkstraSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edge","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Weight","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edge","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each source is discovered first, at distance zero. Then, while a discovered vertex is not yet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"settled, the one with the smallest distance is examined (settled at that distance), and each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of its out-edges is examined in turn with the distance it offers its target: the examined"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex’s distance plus the edge’s weight. An edge into an unsettled target is then relaxed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the offer is smaller than the target’s distance or the target was not yet discovered, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not relaxed. A relaxed edge to an undiscovered target is followed by that target’s discovery."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An edge into a settled vertex, a self-loop included, is examined and nothing more. After its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"last out-edge the examined vertex is finished. Vertices the sources do not reach are never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reported."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/dijkstrasearchevent"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","generated":true,"title":"Enumeration Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent\/discover(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/S